cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "HubScan: Find poisoned documents in RAG corpora by geometry"
abstract: >-
  HubScan detects poisoned documents in retrieval-augmented generation corpora
  by their hubness in embedding space, the topical spread of the queries they
  answer, and instruction-like content, without attack signatures.
authors:
  - family-names: Sadayamuthu
    given-names: Karthikeyan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-3539-6048"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/sadayamuthu/hubscan"
url: "https://openastra.org"
keywords:
  - RAG
  - data poisoning
  - embeddings
  - hubness
  - LLM security
